  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ELast updated August 8, 2025\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAt \u003Cstrong\u003EVepo, LLC\u003C/strong\u003E, we are committed to making our website accessible to everyone, including individuals with disabilities. We are actively working to ensure our website aligns with the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA and the requirements of Title II of the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA).\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EQuestions or concerns? Reading this Privacy Notice will help you understand your privacy rights and choices. We are responsible for making decisions about how your personal information is processed. If you do not agree with our policies and practices, please do not use our Services. If you still have any questions or concerns, please contact us at \u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022mailto:team@envirotrax.com\u0022 title=\u0022mailto:team@envirotrax.com\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003Eteam@envirotrax.com\u003C/a\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWhile our website may not yet meet every accessibility standard, we are striving to achieve full compliance by \u003Cstrong\u003EApril 24, 2026\u003C/strong\u003E. If you experience any difficulty accessing content or functionality, please contact us at \u003Ca data-router-slot=\u0022disabled\u0022 href=\u0022mailto:administrator@envirotrax.com\u0022 title=\u0022mailto:administrator@envirotrax.com\u0022 type=\u0022external\u0022\u003Eadministrator@envirotrax.com\u003C/a\u003E or call \u003Cstrong\u003E281-476-6886\u003C/strong\u003E. Your feedback is important to us and helps guide our improvement efforts.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </content>
